# LockDebugLogs
Module500001Name = Space guard
Module500001Desc = Safety timers for Debug Logs (auto-disable module or delete log file)
LockDebugLogsDesc = Safety timers for Debug Logs (auto-disable module or delete log file)
LockDebugLogsDescLong = Adds scheduled safeguards so Debug Logs cannot stay enabled or grow log files indefinitely. Does not modify Dolibarr core.

